<title>USA: Oravax to cut costs, jobs.</title>
<headline>Oravax to cut costs, jobs.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>OraVax Inc said Thursday it will institute a reorganization plan designed to reduce operating expenses.</p>
<p>The company said it wants to cut about 20 positions, leaving it with 65 full-time employees.</p>
<p>The company also said it is currently seeking a corporate partner to facilitate commercial development in the U.S. and Europe of certain of its products.</p>
<p>OraVax is a biopharmaceutical company engaged in the discovery and development of oral vaccines and noninjected antibody products to prevent or treat diseases which infect the human body at its mucosal linings.</p>
</text>
